{{header modding}}

'''Modding''' is the act of modifying graphics and/or gameplay elements of the base game (in other words, creating mods).

Modding for the Afterbirth+/Repentance and non-Afterbirth+ versions are very different, so they have been separated into two pages which are linked to above.

For more information regarding general modding and modding tools, see the two links above or the modding wikitable below.

